d-only stays focusable; neither form judges. api.test.ts (+7): replay and send post JSON to their doors and return the FlowView; an unchanged replay posts {}; 400/422/502/504 throw the core's sentence unwrapped from both doors. FlowList (+2): the sent mark in the reserved box and one face per provenance. FlowDetail (+2): replay beside copy as curl, absent without a handler. CaptureControls (+2): new request after import… wearing ↗; the import paste box is Field's multi-line box. Mutation-checked by hand: dropping the Esc defaultPrevented guard, the late-reply serial check, the Host omission, the focus hand-back and the remove-focus each turn a test red." }
